      "1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. Bg5 e6 7. f4. im black, rated ~1650 rapid. this is the najdorf with bg5 and i always get crushed. is there a simpler line for black or should i just not play the najdorf"
