    "create_time": 1769837971.81,
    "update_time": null,
    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "Kan (1.e4 c5 2.Nf3 e6 3.d4 cxd4 4.Nxd4 a6):\n- Develop flexibly: …Qc7, …Nf6, …b5, …Bb7, …d6 or …d5 depending on White's setup.\n- Against 5.Bd3 (most common), …Bc5 or …Nf6 with …Qc7; aim for …d6 and a hedgehog-like structure if White plays c4.\n- Typical breaks: …b5–b4, …d5 once you're developed, or …Nc6 to trade White's strong d4 knight.\n- Don't rush …d5 before castling; the e-file opens toward your king.\n\nPlay 10–15 games and review where you're losing."
     ]
    },
